**/public/pagefind/

# Cloudflare Wrangler local state
.wrangler/

# Bun lockfiles are committed. The workspace root lockfile at ./bun.lock is the
# only one bun reads for sdk/, providers/*, and packages/* — a lockfile inside a
# workspace member is never consulted, so `bun install --frozen-lockfile` there
# silently installs from the registry unless the root lockfile is present.
